### P2P 송금
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers/p2p
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "senderCardId": 1,
  "receiverUserId": 2,
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "점심값"
}

### 출금 (연동 계좌로 환급)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cardId": 1,
  "targetAccountNo": "0012345678901234",
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "생활비 출금"
}

### 송금 내역 조회 (기본)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 송금 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
